                  note: 'For three months a year Deosai is a plateau of flowers and standing water. For the other nine it is snow, and nobody argues with it.' },

                { thumb: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1418065460487-3e41a6c84dc5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=75',
                  full:  'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1418065460487-3e41a6c84dc5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=85',
                  title: 'Sunlit Pines',
                  place: 'Shogran · Kaghan Valley',
